# Binary files must never be line-ending converted. The demo recognises a sample invoice by the SHA-256 of
# its source PDF bytes, so a checkout that rewrote LF to CRLF (Git for Windows with core.autocrlf=true does this to
# files it mistakes for text) made the demo recognise nothing on any other platform.
*.pdf binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.tif binary
*.tiff binary
*.webp binary
